3c/strong\u003e khi dùng ngoài trời\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Cảm giác dùng tốt hơn, cảm ứng mượt mà\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Dễ dán tại nhà\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- Sản phẩm dành cho \u003cstrong\u003eOppo Reno7/Reno7 Z 5G\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLưu ý: Do thiết kế full màn toàn diện nên tất cả kính full màn trên thị trường đều có viền kính che vào màn hình 1 chút nhưng hoàn toàn không ảnh hưởng đến trải nghiệm của người dùng\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e4/e8/d7/6ea38736400502d0feb0cdbc8064d027.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e4/e8/d7/6ea38736400502d0feb0cdbc8064d027.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/52/14/69/cf86f22df03fe5a39022c81fd775ed73.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/52/14/69/cf86f22df03fe5a39022c81fd775ed73.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/af/94/74/725854a60ed9b57f21522d5bdee2d7cc.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/af/94/74/725854a60ed9b57f21522d5bdee2d7cc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/66/98/c8/9c7c6426fc132cda05daa4cb1d60c4e0.JPG\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/66/98/c8/9c7c6426fc132cda05daa4cb1d60c4e0.JPG\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e9/d9/57/8d81318eb56a82e74184b2fd8d5025f0.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/e9/d9/57/8d81318eb56a82e74184b2fd8d5025f0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"364\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg id=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/tmp/8b/f7/54/6d139bd1a96e871ad0925aef50f2512f.jpg\" title=\"\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/